1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,427
It needs no membrane, no energy and no living cell.

2
00:00:04,427 --> 00:00:07,812
It is how carbon dioxide reaches a leaf cell.

3
00:00:07,812 --> 00:00:11,080
But it is fast only over tiny distances.

4
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:16,588
Over metres it is hopelessly slow, which is exactly why a plant needs xylem.

